<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tellabs EPS view up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tellabs EPS view up.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said it raised Tellabs Inc's 1997 earnings estimate to $1.23 a share from $1.15 a share.</p>
<p>-- said it raised the 1998 earnings view to $1.60 a share from $1.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- said reiterated an outperform rating and set a $50 a share target price.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Tellabs gained 2-1/4 to 43-5/8</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
